on", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:30:32Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "It's fun reading up for the prep", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:30:37Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Next", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:31:05Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "4. In the 1980s, X was targeted by religious groups and the media (including a 60 Minutes segment), claiming the game led to devil worship and suicide. Statistics later showed that teenagers who played X were actually less likely to commit suicide than the general population. The controversy provided millions of dollars in free advertising. Sales skyrocketed as teenagers flocked to play the forbidden game their parents were afraid of. Id X", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:31:22Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "dnd", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:31:22Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "d and D", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:31:35Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Nice!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:31:52Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Nice question", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:31:58Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Dungeons and Dragons is correct. Dave Arneson one of the co founders passed away on this day in 2009", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:32:22Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Next might be easy", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:32:33Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "5. While in France, X fell in love with a woman named Annette Vallon. They had a daughter, Caroline, in 1792. However, the outbreak of war between England and France forced him to return home, leaving them behind. He supported them financially when he could, but the relationship remained a family secret for over a century, only coming to light in the early 20th century. His famous sonnet, \"It is a beauteous evening, calm and free,\" was actually written about a walk on the beach with his daughter Caroline when he finally visited her ten years later. Id X.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:32:48Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "WW", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:32:48Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Wordsworth", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-07T16:32:52Z", "username": "Tapish", "text": "Wordsworth", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]